  "diagnosticContract": [
    "the oracle exists only in isolated clones and may read target labels; no oracle state, label, gradient, or optimized weight is written back to the online system",
    "nodes, sensory weights, recurrent topology, 48 adjustable recurrent slots, A-trained action readout, task streams, and evaluation budget remain frozen",
    "the norm-envelope oracle projects each target pair to its carrier reference norm; the absolute-bound oracle changes the same 48 values only and clamps them to the existing absolute weight limit",
    "true-target and shuffled-target oracles use identical iterations, restarts, training trials, optimizer, and bounds; frozen weights use the same evaluation streams",
    "development selects one learning rate; independent confirmation cannot change optimizer settings, controls, thresholds, or the decision order",
    "failure means the preregistered high-information search did not reach the threshold; it is empirical evidence, not a proof of mathematical impossibility"
